{"title":"🚀 CONNECT & GROW: Work from Anywhere Revolution!","startsAt":"2026-11-05T18:00:00-05:00","endsAt":"2026-11-05T19:00:00-05:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"🚀 CONNECT & GROW THURSDAY'S🤝\n\nWork from Anywhere Revolution!\n📍EMPOWERED4X Coworking Office - 350 Rutherford Rd S, Brampton (Suite #104)\n\n(Look for the GLASS Building PLAZA II - main floor beside washrooms - across from Playdium - NOT the Brown Building - go to PLAZA II GLASS Building)\n🗓 1st Thursday (Monthly), Nov 05, 2026\n⏰ 6:00 PM – 7:00 PM\n[https://WAR120526.eventbrite.ca](https://war120526.eventbrite.ca/)\n\nCalling all small business owners, entrepreneurs & side-hustlers! 👋\nJoin us for Connect & Grow, a high-energy Power Hour designed to help you:\n\n✨ Expand your professional network\n✨ Build real connections & collaborations\n✨ Learn about LegalShield services and a work-from-anywhere opportunity to create an additional stream of income to your portfolio\n✨ Get inspired by like-minded professionals who are serious about growth\n\n💥 Cost: FREE to attend\n🍔🍹 Kindly support our amazing host, Union Social, by purchasing food and/or drinks during the event.\n\nSpots are limited—RSVP now to secure your place and show up ready to connect, learn, and grow! 🌱\n\n👉 Register today & bring a friend!\n[https://WAR120526.eventbrite.ca](https://war120526.eventbrite.ca/)\n\n#ConnectAndGrow #PowerHour #MississaugaNetworking #EntrepreneurLife #SmallBusinessOwners #SideHustle #WorkFromHome #LegalShield #SupportLocal 💼✨🍽️","venue":{"name":"Plaza II","address":"350 Rutherford Rd S, Brampton, ON L6W 3P6, Canada, Brampton","lat":43.681897,"lng":-79.717523,"city":"Brampton"},"fee":null,"group":"Networking Night in Toronto","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/8/f/a/9/highres_532596777.jpeg"}